Indo-Myanmar border areas for non-commercial purposes
8 ATAEF1096E Importers importing goods for display or use in fairs/ exhibitions or
similar events under provisions of ATA carnet. This IEC number can
also be used by importers importing for exhibitions/fairs as per
Paragraph 2.60 of Handbook of Procedures
9 IDNBG1100E Director, National Blood Group
