exhibits for each exhibitor. (b) Freely importable items: However, sale of exhibits of items which are freely
importable shall be allowed within bond period allowed for re-export on
payment of applicable customs duties. pg.', 'Sale of Exhibits governs how DGFT business controls should be applied, validated, and enforced.', 'Sale of Exhibits explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include 2.61 Sale of Exhibits
