(a) Certificate of Origin (Co O) is an instrument to establish evidence on origin of
goods imported into any country.', 'Indha Certificates of Origin (Co O) section-la, 2.90 Certificates of Origin (Co O)
(a) Certificate of Origin (Co O) is an instrument to establish evidence on origin of
