the GSP Scheme.', 'Certificates of Origin (Co O) governs how DGFT business controls should be applied, validated, and enforced.', 'Certificates of Origin (Co O) explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include (iii) Further, as per the conditions required to avail GSP benefit under self-
