such self-certified certificates of origin.', 'Indha Certificates of Origin (Co O) section-la, Certificates of Origin (Co O) explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include (iii) Further, as per the conditions required to avail GSP benefit under self-
certification system, the beneficiary country needs to have a verification system of
